## 7. Conclusion

The review identified several vulnerabilities including SQL Injection, insecure password handling, Cross-Site Scripting, and unsafe credential transmission. Implementing parameterized queries, password hashing, secure output handling, and proper authentication practices will significantly improve the application's security posture.

